可以。我们就从 **v0.1：当前目录半自动跑通** 开始。

你的 v0.1 目标是：

```text
agent-dev run task.yaml
```

它只做 5 件事：

```text
1. 检查 task.yaml 存在
2. 创建 .agent-dev/runs/<run-id>/
3. 让 Claude Code 生成 plan.md
4. 保存 plan.md 和日志
5. 让 opencode 按 plan.md 执行
```

先不做 worktree、commit、push、PR、resume。你原方案里这些东西都可以后面加。fileciteturn0file0

---

## 第一步：先手动验证两个命令能跑

在一个测试项目目录里先试：

```bash
claude -p "Say hello and exit."
```

Claude Code 官方 CLI 文档里，`claude -p "query"` 是“查询后退出”的非交互模式，适合脚本调用。citeturn908826view0

再试：

```bash
opencode run "Explain this project briefly."
```

OpenCode 官方文档里，`opencode run [message..]` 是非交互模式，适合 scripting / automation。citeturn845840view0

这两个能跑，再开始写 `agent-dev`。

---

## 第二步：创建项目

```bash
mkdir agent-dev
cd agent-dev

mkdir src
touch CMakeLists.txt
touch src/main.cpp
```

`CMakeLists.txt` 先写最小版：

```cmake
cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.20)
project(agent_dev)

set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 20)
set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)

add_executable(agent-dev src/main.cpp)
```

---

## 第三步：第一版不要解析 YAML

你现在不需要 `yaml-cpp`。

第一版只需要把 `task.yaml` 当普通文本读进去，拼进 prompt 里。这样难度会低很多。

`src/main.cpp` 可以先写成这样：

```cpp
#include <chrono>
#include <cstdlib>
#include <filesystem>
#include <fstream>
#include <iomanip>
#include <iostream>
#include <sstream>
#include <string>

namespace fs = std::filesystem;

std::string read_file(const fs::path& path) {
    std::ifstream in(path);
    if (!in) {
        throw std::runtime_error("Failed to open file: " + path.string());
    }

    std::ostringstream ss;
    ss << in.rdbuf();
    return ss.str();
}

void write_file(const fs::path& path, const std::string& content) {
    std::ofstream out(path);
    if (!out) {
        throw std::runtime_error("Failed to write file: " + path.string());
    }

    out << content;
}

std::string shell_quote(const std::string& s) {
    std::string result = "'";
    for (char c : s) {
        if (c == '\'') {
            result += "'\\''";
        } else {
            result += c;
        }
    }
    result += "'";
    return result;
}

std::string make_run_id() {
    auto now = std::chrono::system_clock::now();
    std::time_t t = std::chrono::system_clock::to_time_t(now);

    std::tm tm{};
#ifdef _WIN32
    localtime_s(&tm, &t);
#else
    localtime_r(&t, &tm);
#endif

    std::ostringstream ss;
    ss << std::put_time(&tm, "%Y%m%d-%H%M%S");
    return ss.str();
}

int run_command_to_file(const std::string& command, const fs::path& output_file) {
    std::string full_command = command + " > " + shell_quote(output_file.string()) + " 2>&1";
    return std::system(full_command.c_str());
}

int main(int argc, char** argv) {
    try {
        if (argc != 3 || std::string(argv[1]) != "run") {
            std::cerr << "Usage: agent-dev run task.yaml\n";
            return 1;
        }

        fs::path task_path = argv[2];

        if (!fs::exists(task_path)) {
            std::cerr << "Task file not found: " << task_path << "\n";
            return 1;
        }

        std::string task_text = read_file(task_path);

        std::string run_id = make_run_id();
        fs::path run_dir = fs::path(".agent-dev") / "runs" / run_id;
        fs::create_directories(run_dir);

        fs::copy_file(task_path, run_dir / "task.yaml", fs::copy_options::overwrite_existing);

        fs::path claude_prompt_path = run_dir / "claude_prompt.md";
        fs::path plan_path = run_dir / "plan.md";
        fs::path claude_log_path = run_dir / "claude-plan.log";
        fs::path opencode_prompt_path = run_dir / "opencode_prompt.md";
        fs::path opencode_log_path = run_dir / "opencode.log";
        fs::path state_path = run_dir / "state.json";

        std::string claude_prompt =
            "You are the planning agent for a local developer automation tool.\n\n"
            "Read the task below and create a clear implementation plan.\n\n"
            "Rules:\n"
            "- Output Markdown only.\n"
            "- Do not modify files.\n"
            "- Do not run commands.\n"
            "- Create a practical step-by-step plan for an execution agent.\n"
            "- Include likely files to inspect, implementation steps, and tests to run.\n\n"
            "# Task\n\n"
            "```yaml\n" + task_text + "\n```\n";

        write_file(claude_prompt_path, claude_prompt);

        std::cout << "Created run directory: " << run_dir << "\n";
        std::cout << "Generating plan with Claude Code...\n";

        std::string claude_command =
            "cat " + shell_quote(claude_prompt_path.string()) +
            " | claude -p";

        int claude_result = run_command_to_file(claude_command, plan_path);

        if (claude_result != 0) {
            write_file(state_path, "{ \"status\": \"claude_failed\" }\n");
            std::cerr << "Claude Code failed. Check: " << plan_path << "\n";
            return 1;
        }

        std::string plan_text = read_file(plan_path);

        std::string opencode_prompt =
            "You are the execution agent.\n\n"
            "Implement the task according to the plan below.\n\n"
            "Rules:\n"
            "- Modify project files as needed.\n"
            "- Do not commit changes.\n"
            "- Do not push changes.\n"
            "- Do not create pull requests.\n"
            "- Prefer minimal changes.\n"
            "- Run relevant tests if possible.\n"
            "- At the end, summarize what you changed and what tests you ran.\n\n"
            "# Task\n\n"
            "```yaml\n" + task_text + "\n```\n\n"
            "# Plan\n\n" +
            plan_text + "\n";

        write_file(opencode_prompt_path, opencode_prompt);

        std::cout << "Running opencode...\n";

        std::string opencode_command =
            "opencode run --file " + shell_quote(opencode_prompt_path.string()) +
            " \"Follow the attached prompt and implement the requested changes.\"";

        int opencode_result = run_command_to_file(opencode_command, opencode_log_path);

        if (opencode_result != 0) {
            write_file(state_path, "{ \"status\": \"opencode_failed\" }\n");
            std::cerr << "opencode failed. Check: " << opencode_log_path << "\n";
            return 1;
        }

        write_file(
            state_path,
            "{\n"
            "  \"status\": \"completed\",\n"
            "  \"run_id\": \"" + run_id + "\",\n"
            "  \"task_file\": \"task.yaml\",\n"
            "  \"plan_file\": \"plan.md\",\n"
            "  \"opencode_log\": \"opencode.log\"\n"
            "}\n"
        );

        std::cout << "\nDone.\n";
        std::cout << "Run directory: " << run_dir << "\n";
        std::cout << "Plan: " << plan_path << "\n";
        std::cout << "opencode log: " << opencode_log_path << "\n";
        std::cout << "\nNext step: review changes with:\n";
        std::cout << "  git diff\n";

        return 0;
    } catch (const std::exception& e) {
        std::cerr << "Error: " << e.what() << "\n";
        return 1;
    }
}
```

---

## 第四步：编译运行

```bash
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build
```

然后在一个测试 Git 项目里运行：

```bash
/path/to/agent-dev/build/agent-dev run task.yaml
```

跑完看：

```bash
ls .agent-dev/runs
git diff
```

---

## 第五步：准备一个超小 task.yaml 测试

不要一开始拿复杂项目测。先拿一个玩具项目，比如只有一个 `README.md` 或一个小函数。

```yaml
goal: "给 README 增加项目介绍"

background: |
  当前 README 太简单，希望增加一段项目说明。

acceptance_criteria:
  - "README 中有一段项目介绍"
  - "不要删除原有内容"

constraints:
  - "只修改 README.md"
  - "不要 commit"
```

这样你能快速确认：目录创建、Claude 生成计划、opencode 执行、日志保存，全链路都通了。

---

## 你接下来只需要完成 3 个小目标

先按这个顺序：

```text
目标 1：能编译出 agent-dev
目标 2：agent-dev run task.yaml 能生成 .agent-dev/runs/<run-id>/plan.md
目标 3：opencode 能根据 plan 改文件，然后你用 git diff 人工检查
```

做到这一步，你的 MVP 就已经成立了。  
下一步再加 `status` 命令、漂亮日志、错误信息、Git 检查。
